Value CHASSIS (\d+)
Value FAN_TRAY (\d+)
Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value HARDWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value CPLD_VERSION (\S+)
Value FAN_NUMBER (\d+)
Value TEMPERATURE (\d+)
Value HIGH_TEMPERATURE_ALARM_THRESHOLD (\d+)
Value LOW_SPEED_ALARM_THRESHOLD (\d+)

Start
  ^Fan-tray verbose state on chassis ${CHASSIS}: -> Chassis

Chassis
  ^Fan-tray ${FAN_TRAY}: -> Tray

Tray
  ^Software version:\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}
  ^Hardware version:\s+${HARDWARE_VERSION}
  ^CPLD version:\s+${CPLD_VERSION}
  ^Fan number:\s+${FAN_NUMBER}
  ^Temperature:\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+°C
  ^High temperature alarm threshold:\s+${HIGH_TEMPERATURE_ALARM_THRESHOLD}\s+°C
  ^Low speed alarm threshold:\s+${LOW_SPEED_ALARM_THRESHOLD}\s+rpm -> Record Start
  ^-+
